@title 3D Heat: with Reduce motion on, a fan opening stays a still frame
@area 3D
# Run with KOPERCAD_MOTION=1 so motion is possible; Preferences > Reduce motion then has to hold the fan and the air dashes still: the two pictures are identical.
click_text "Open example"
wait 20
click_text 3D #1
wait 30
click_text Heat #1
wait 20
click_text "Add opening"
wait 10
click_text "Filter fan, low on the door"
wait 20
key ctrl+k
wait 6
text preferences
wait 8
key Enter
wait 10
scroll 683 400 -3000
wait 6
shot preferences
click_text "Reduce motion"
wait 10
shot preferences-ticked
key Escape
wait 20
shot reduced-a
wait 30
shot reduced-b
check_layout
